  "applications_text": "ECA 1000L is a clear light to yellow liquid with a pour point at about -27\u00b0C. It is used in converting epoxy resins to highly crosslinked polymers with excellent physical and electrical properties. ECA 1000L performs well when used in demanding applications, such as filament winding, pultrusion, and other forms of lamination, as well as electrical encapsulating, insulating, casting, and potting.",
